[2.011, "o", "== A. parse external .gltf + load buffers ==\r\n  ok:   parse source gltf\r\n  ok:   load external .bin\r\n== B. write single-file GLB ==\r\n  ok:   cgltf_write_file GLB returns success\r\n== C. read GLB back and compare structure ==\r\n  ok:   re-parse written GLB\r\n  ok:   detected as GLB\r\n  ok:   meshes_count equal\r\n  ok:   materials_count equal\r\n  ok:   nodes_count equal\r\n  ok:   accessors_count equal\r\n  ok:   buffer_views_count equal\r\n  ok:   buffers_count equal\r\n  ok:   scenes_count equal\r\n  ok:   images_count equal\r\n  ok:   textures_count equal\r\n  ok:   GLB BIN chunk holds full logical payload (plus <=3 pad bytes)\r\n  ok:   bin payload byte-identical (logical length)\r\n  ok:   buffers[0].byteLength equal\r\n  ok:   GLB buffers[0] has no uri\r\n  ok:   primitive count equal\r\n  ok:   mesh name preserved\r\n  ok:   node name preserved\r\n  ok:   accessor[0].count equal\r\n  ok:   accessor[0].component_type equal\r\n  ok:   index accessor component_type equal\r\n  ok:   bufferView[0].byteLength equal\r\n  ok:   bufferView[1].byteOffset equal\r\n== D. container layout: alignment + self-consistency ==\r\n  ok:   file >= 12-byte header\r\n  ok:   magic glTF\r\n  ok:   version == 2\r\n  ok:   header total length == actual file size\r\n  ok:   JSON chunk magic\r\n  ok:   JSON chunk length 4-byte aligned\r\n  ok:   JSON chunk length matches payload + padding\r\n  ok:   JSON padding does not shrink payload\r\n  ok:   BIN chunk magic\r\n  ok:   BIN chunk length 4-byte aligned\r\n  ok:   BIN chunk length matches payload + padding\r\n  ok:   BIN chunk is last and fills file\r\n== E. second write from GLB data is stable ==\r\n  ok:   rewrite parsed GLB\r\n  ok:   GLB->GLB output size stable\r\n  ok:   rewritten files fully read\r\n  ok:   GLB->GLB bytes identical\r\n== F. invalid inputs rejected with error codes ==\r\n  ok:   NULL path -> invalid_options\r\n  ok:   no file created for NULL path\r\n  ok:   NULL data -> invalid_options\r